        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Overview]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror game that challenges you to play three different games and diagnoses your tolerance for fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Features]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three types of horror games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three types of horror games are available: “Surprise Horror,” “Hide Horror,” and “Escape Horror.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing difficulty according to player ability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A “ability test” is conducted in advance to measure “judgment,” “memory,” and “observation .” The game difficulty increases according to the results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906770/extras/800039c0417e7d30c75cf1079a72717a.avif?t=1766114644\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906770/extras/14e56cb512893c9e11859d8260e8d8c0.avif?t=1766114644\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Introduction to each game】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Surprise Horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game where you exorcise ghosts lurking in the mansion and aim to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906770/extras/b6b39dd914955db45989c8aa609831d9.avif?t=1766114644\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Hide Horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game in which you hide from life forms that have taken over a hospital and attempt to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906770/extras/6c161a010503975a41012240c4380acb.avif?t=1766114644\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Escape Horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game in which you must overcome your fears and escape from school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906770/extras/79bcd53271b1c7e6f43edff4d63dd2a2.avif?t=1766114644\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Play Time】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40–60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Live Streaming and Broadcasting】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following guidelines apply to live streaming, broadcasting, and video posting of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please include the game's URL in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individuals and organizations may publicly share gameplay videos and live streams of this game online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization of videos (ad revenue, donations, etc.) is permitted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming or broadcasting content that violates public order and morality, or contains discriminatory or extreme expressions, is prohibited.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developer shall not be held liable for any damages (data loss, equipment issues, revenue reduction, disputes, etc.) arising from the streaming, posting, or viewing of this game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※This guideline may be revised without prior notice. Please always refer to the latest version.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Overview]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror game that challenges you to play three different games and diagnoses your tolerance for fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Features]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three types of horror games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three types of horror games are available: “Surprise Horror,” “Hide Horror,” and “Escape Horror.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing difficulty according to player ability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A “ability test” is conducted in advance to measure “judgment,” “memory,” and “observation .” The game difficulty increases according to the results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906770/extras/800039c0417e7d30c75cf1079a72717a.avif?t=1766114644\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906770/extras/14e56cb512893c9e11859d8260e8d8c0.avif?t=1766114644\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Introduction to each game】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Surprise Horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game where you exorcise ghosts lurking in the mansion and aim to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906770/extras/b6b39dd914955db45989c8aa609831d9.avif?t=1766114644\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Hide Horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game in which you hide from life forms that have taken over a hospital and attempt to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 